# NearMe configuration reference
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file lists every configuration NAME the system uses. It contains no secrets
# and is safe to commit. Real values belong in:
#   - Backend, local:      dotnet user-secrets (see README "Configuration")
#   - Frontend, local:     frontend/.env.local (copy frontend/.env.example)
#   - CI:                  GitHub Actions secrets / generated at runtime
#   - Deployed:            Azure App Service settings / Key Vault, Vercel env vars
#
# ASP.NET Core reads environment variables with "__" as the section separator,
# e.g. ConnectionStrings__NearMeDatabase maps to ConnectionStrings:NearMeDatabase.
# Note: the backend does NOT load .env files; these are names, not a runtime file.

# --- Backend (NearMe.Api) ---------------------------------------------------
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development
ConnectionStrings__NearMeDatabase=
Cors__AllowedOrigins__0=http://localhost:5173

# --- Frontend (Vite) --------------------------------------------------------
# Public: embedded in the JavaScript bundle. Never place secrets in VITE_* variables.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5080

# --- Tests ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Disposable SQL Server database for NearMe.IntegrationTests. Never point at real data.
NEARME_TEST_SQL_CONNECTION=
